1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Rasulullah

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:04,800
ketika itu sedang berdoa di Bukit Safa.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,330
Tiba-tiba Rasulullah memanggil

4
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:09,240
mereka dan bertanya.

5
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:11,110
Rasulullah panggil Ansar ni.

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,020
Kata Nabi, apa yang kamu kumpul?

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,170
Sembang, kata Nabi.

8
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:18,260
Apa yang kamu kumpul?

9
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:22,020
Kata Nabi, aku tahu kamu sembang

10
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,120
apa ini.

11
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:26,090
Mereka menjawablah, la syai'a ya

12
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:27,290
Rasulullah.

13
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,320
Tak ada apa-apa wahai Rasulullah.

14
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,410
Tak ada apa.

15
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,900
Setelah Rasulullah mengulangi dan

16
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,050
mendesak, akhirnya mereka mengaku

17
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,790
perkara yang mereka bincangkan.

18
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,980
Apa yang kamu sembang tadi?

19
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,600
Apa sebenarnya yang mereka sembang?

20
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,100
Bahawa mereka ini dah susah hati.

21
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,130
Takut Rasulullah tak nak balik.

22
00:00:59,130 --> 00:01:00,620
Dia tak nak balik Madinah.

23
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:02,740
Takut kamu nak tinggal di Makkah ini.

24
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:07,200
Maklum sajalah, tanah tumpah darah kamu.

25
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,114
Begitulah.

26
00:01:08,114 --> 00:01:11,070
Adik-beradik, sepupu-sepapat semua

27
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:11,940
di sini.

28
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:15,180
Takutlah, wahai Rasulullah tak nak

29
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:17,180
balik dah Madinah.

30
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:19,860
Lalu Rasulullah SAW bersabda,

31
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:23,683
ma'azallah, al-mahya mahyakum wal

32
00:01:23,683 --> 00:01:25,502
mamat mamatukum.

33
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:28,460
Allah melindungi perkara itu, kata Nabi.

34
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:31,540
Hidup dan matiku bersama kamu semua.

35
00:01:35,050 --> 00:01:38,420
Kata Nabi, aku balik bersama kamu.

36
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:42,340
Hidup dan mati aku bersama kamu.

37
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:44,180
Nabi akan balik ke Madinah.
